# Norix batch 11/24/2026: 7 Forté products (sheet rows 195-210). Sources: live pages (live/, page/), norix.com Forté pages (site/),
# Norix spec sheets (spec/*.txt: FC600 9/24, FC620/FC660 9/24, FC620/FC680 9/24, FT600 12/24, CA4200/CA4242/CA4800 12/24, CA4242-DF 4/25,
# FO molded 12/24, FO wood 9/24), Forté brochure 2023, price list April 2026 pp. 15-16 (seating) and 49-50 (tables).
# New Norix rules (Andrew Nov 24): MT ends " at Anchortex"; MD = "Norix <product> is ... Shop it at Anchortex." (<=195); "No assembly is required" as a bullet.
TH='https://www.anchortex.com/collections/bh-shelter-transitional-housing'
LINKS=f"Explore Anchortex's [Behavioral Healthcare Anti-Ligature Furniture]({BH}), [Prison and Detention Furniture]({CDF}), and [Transitional Housing Furniture]({TH}) collections for more institutional furniture."
FORTE_SERIES=[
('h3','[H2] About Norix Forté Furniture'),
('p','Norix Forté is a designer series of seating and tables that brings comfort and a less institutional look to intensive-use rooms in behavioral healthcare and correctional facilities. The chairs and molded bases are rotationally molded from high-impact polyethylene with Norix TruColor polymer, and many pieces can be ballasted, bolted down, or ganged together.'),
('p','The Forté series includes:'),
('b1','**Guest Chairs:** Guest arm and armless chairs, with or without upholstery'),
('b1','**Lounge Chairs:** Lounge arm and armless chairs on a molded plinth base or a solid hardwood base, with or without upholstery'),
('b1','**Café Tables:** A 36” round molded table, 42” and 48” round and 42” square laminate tops, and a 42” square DuoForm top, all on a molded hourglass base'),
('b1','**Occasional Tables:** 27” square laminate-top tables on a molded or wood base, which can be ganged with lounge chairs as intermediate or corner tables'),
]
FORTE_NEW='New series section: the seven Forté products in this batch share an "About Norix Forté Furniture" section based on the Norix Forté brochure and price list. It has no links to individual products. I used it instead of the "About Norix Seating" section because the batch has both chairs and tables. Please review it here; any changes will be applied to all the Forté tabs.'
CHAIR_COLORS='**Seat Colors:** Twilight, Cove, Sage, Clay, Sand, or Dove; extended colors Citrus, Tranquil, Malibu, Cobalt, Wisteria, LUX Ivory, and LUX Onyx have a 6-piece minimum per color'
UPH='**Optional Upholstery:** Factory-installed upholstered plywood shell with polyurethane foam on the seat and back, double stitched with concealed staples; it can be removed for cleaning or replacement'
CHEM='**Chemical Resistance:** Resists blood, vinegar, urine, feces, salt solution, and chlorine solution'
TRU='**TruColor Polymer:** Fully compounded color for consistent color and durability'
CH_LOAD='**Static Load Testing:** Tested to 750 lbs'
CH_PERF='**Performance Standards:** Dynamic drop tested to twice the ANSI/BIFMA X5.4 impact force (250 lbs from 18”)'
CH_FLAM1='**Flammability Standards (Not Upholstered):** California Technical Bulletins 133 and 117; UL 1056; ASTM E1537; NFPA 261; UL 94 HB; BS 7176:2007 high hazard'
CH_FLAM2='**Flammability Standards (Upholstered):** California Technical Bulletin 117, with an optional TB133 upholstery upgrade'
CH_CLEAN='**Cleaning:** Simple Green or a similar cleaner for routine cleaning; bleach and water solutions and hospital-grade disinfectants such as Virex, Wexcide, or Oxivir Five 16 can be used per the manufacturer’s instructions; follow the fabric maker’s instructions for upholstery'
TBL_CLEAN='**Cleaning:** Simple Green or a similar cleaner for the top; the molded base can also be cleaned with bleach and water solutions and hospital-grade disinfectants such as Virex, Wexcide, or Oxivir Five 16 per the manufacturer’s instructions'
WOOD_CLEAN='**Cleaning:** Simple Green or a similar cleaner for the top; a mild wood cleaner for routine cleaning of the base, and a regular-strength wood cleaner for tougher stains and marks'
LAM_COLORS='**Laminate Top Colors:** Titanium Evolve, Wild Cherry, Kensington Maple, Asian Sun, Montana Walnut, Palisades Oak, Calcutta Marble, or Black Alicante'
PRICE_OK='Prices checked: {} No change.'
PHOTO_KEEP='Images: the {} current images are kept{}.'
OLD_ABOUT='Removed: the long old series paragraph and the long old "About Norix Furniture" paragraph; replaced with the new Forté section and the standard paragraph used on all Norix pages.'
COLL='Collections: the {} is already in Behavioral Healthcare, Prison and Detention Furniture, Transitional Housing, and Norix Furniture. I added a Transitional Housing Furniture link, since all seven Forté products are in that collection.'

